******************************************************
* Synthetic 1k-Device CDL Netlist for Benchmarking
* Generated to match the pattern of netlist_10k.cdl but with 1,000 devices
******************************************************
.INCLUDE dummy_subckt.cdl
.PARAM wireopt=1111111
.SUBCKT parallel_reduce GND PAD VDD
*.PININFO GND:I PAD:I VDD:I
* Auto-generated devices: 1,000 entries
* Pattern: XD<idx> GND PAD net<group> sub! esddiode areapd=2.925e-11 perimpd=150u nf=1
* Grouping: 50 devices per net (net1..net20)
* ---- AUTO-GENERATED DEVICES ----
